# Ex5 extra run -- basis-set sensitivity: DKH-def2-TZVP instead of DKH-def2-SVP.
# Same BS-DFT setup as the three required calculations: charge -2, high-spin multiplicity 3,
# BrokenSym 1,1. Only the functional (or the basis) is changed, so the effect can be separated
# from the relativistic treatment.
! UKS B3LYP DKH DKH-def2-TZVP SARC/J RIJCOSX TightSCF SlowConv

%maxcore 6000

%scf
  BrokenSym 1,1
  MaxIter   500
end

* xyzfile -2 3 ../ex5_Cu2_geometry_from_canvas.xyz
